    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to bring 114 Palmerstown Avenue to the market, an impressive three-bedroom mid-terrace family home with a converted attic, ideally positioned on this highly sought-after residential avenue in Palmerstown. Offering well-proportioned accommodation across three floors, the property provides an excellent combination of space, comfort, and convenience, making it an ideal home for modern family living.\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable sitting room, a spacious living room, and a bright open-plan kitchen and dining area, along with a conveniently located bathroom.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three spacious bedrooms and a family bathroom, while the third floor provides a versatile attic conversion, offering valuable additional living or storage space.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from ample off-street parking for 2 cars and a superb south-facing rear garden, which enjoys excellent sunlight throughout the day and provides an ideal outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining. To the rear of the garden is a large garage, offering excellent additional storage and versatility, with the added benefit of rear laneway access.\r\n\r\nOverall, 114 Palmerstown Avenue presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and versatile family home coming to the market in turn key condition also in a highly desirable Palmerstown location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway \r\n4.728 x 1.994 \r\nWith wooden flooring , pendant lighting , alarm panel . \r\n\r\nBathroom under stairs \r\n1.248 x 0.822 \r\nWith tiled flooring , WC, WHB \r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n3.893 x 3.669\r\nWith wooden flooring , pendant lighting & fireplace with tiled surroundings \r\n\r\nLiving room\r\n4.153 x 3.692 \r\nWith wooden flooring , fireplace with tiled surroundings , pendant lighting . \r\n\r\nDining room \r\n4.915 x 2.830 \r\nWith wooden flooring , downlights , naturally lighting throughout .\r\n\r\nKitchen \r\n5.875 x 2.531 \r\nWith tiled flooring , range of floor and eye level fitted presses , oven , hob , extractor fan , fridge / freezer \r\n\r\nGarage \r\n6.201 x 4.994 \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\n3.776 x 4,064 \r\nWith carpet flooring , built in wardrobes pendant lighting\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\n3.155 x 3.813\r\nWith laminate wood flooring , built in wardrobe & pendant lighting\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\n2.915 x 2.604\r\nWith laminate wood flooring & pendant lighting \r\n\r\nBathroom \r\n3.430 x 2.282 \r\nWith wooden flooring , bath , shower, WC, WHB & storage cabinet \r\n\r\nAttic conversion bed room \r\n4.253 x 4.583\r\nWith carpet flooring , pendant lighting & built in wardrobes"
